# Sketchy-method visual layer for the discipline tracks.
# SHARED = the recurring cross-track vocabulary, defined ONCE and <use>d everywhere.
# SCENES[track_key] = one persistent world + at most 8 symbols (the coherence cap).
# All art is PLACEHOLDER geometry. Replace the inner markup of any <symbol>; ids, positions and logic stay as they are.
# In art: stroke/fill "currentColor" = ink, var(--sk-accent) = the scene's single accent colour.

